dialogue boss_defeat_greenvalley
title: What the Captain Sold
trigger: StageCleared greenvalley-03
speaker boss moorcaptain
speaker commander $commander

node a boss
  Quota... You think the tithe stops with me? The Choir will send someone who doesn't keep count.
  -> b

node b commander
  Then they'll find the wagon gone and the waystone awake. Where does the colour go, Captain?
  -> c

node c boss
  Up the old road, to the Still, and past it. I never asked further. Nobody who asks comes back to the moor.
  -> d

node d commander
  Then we'll ask. Tell the holds their tithe is their own again.
  -> e

node e boss
  They won't believe it from me.
  -> f

node f commander
  They'll believe it from us.
